Error [E0309]: An optional type can't hold another optional type
  --> optional_lift_nested.jet:5:20
    |
  5 | fn wrap(n: Int) -> Maybe<Int>? {
    |                    ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Int??` isn't supported — use one `?` only (S32)
 Fix: Drop the inner `?` or unwrap before wrapping again
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0309

Error [E0108]: This needs Int??, but the value is Int (a whole number)
  --> optional_lift_nested.jet:6:12
    |
  6 |     return n
    |            ^
 Why: `Int??` means a `Int?` or `None`
 Fix: Use Int? here
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0108
